flowchart LR
  subgraph Reference[Multica responsibilities observed]
    Web[Web shell] --> Shared[Shared TypeScript domain views and client]
    Desktop[Desktop shell] --> Shared
    Shared --> API[Go HTTP and realtime API]
    API --> Intent[Issues, ownership, discussion]
    Intent --> Queue[Durable task attempts]
    Schedule[Scheduler and event wakeups] --> Queue
    Queue --> Runtime[Daemon and provider execution]
    Runtime --> Delivery[Durable terminal delivery]
    Delivery --> Queue
    Intent --> Review[Delivered work and review]
    Queue --> DB[(PostgreSQL state)]
  end
  subgraph Proposed[Lykeion scientific meanings to discuss]
    Question[Versioned research question] --> Grounding[Grounding evidence package]
    Grounding --> Gate[Explicit acceptance decision]
    Gate --> Next[Downstream scientific activity]
    Compute[Computational attempt] --> Artifacts[Versioned artifacts and observations]
    Artifacts --> Gate
    Policy[Budget, permissions and protocol policy] --> Compute
    Policy --> Gate
  end
  Intent -. reinterpret .-> Question
  Queue -. preserve attempt separation .-> Compute
  Delivery -. preserve durable delivery .-> Artifacts
  Review -. replace acceptance target .-> Gate
